  "result": "Archived issues are now filtered out of the board. The cause was in `listBoardColumns` in `src/server/repositories/issue-repository.ts`. Its doc comment says \"live rows only\", but its query never applied the archived-row predicate. The list, count, and export queries all use `livePredicate(issues.archivedAt, …)`, so only the board kept returning archived rows. I added `livePredicate(issues.archivedAt, {})` to that query's `compact(...)` filters, the same pattern `countIssues` uses.",
